&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tenable Data Consent Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable is committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal data. Depending on your location, one or more of the following notices may apply to you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_General_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;General Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_CCPA_Notice_Applicants_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_EEA_UK_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_6-4-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EU/EEA/UK Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Throughout our worldwide network of experts, clients and communities, we are renowned for our leadership in fire protection engineering – a legacy of responsibility we have proudly upheld since 1939. Today, our expertise extends broadly across closely related security and risk-based fields – from accessibility consulting and risk analysis to process safety, forensic investigations, security risk consulting, emergency management, digital innovation and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our engineers and consultants collaborate to solve complex safety and security challenges, ensuring our clients can protect what matters most. For over 80 years, we have helped mitigate risks that threaten lives, property and reputations. Through technology, expertise and industry-leading research, we remain dedicated to our purpose of making our world safe, secure and resilient.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Jensen Hughes, we believe that creating and sustaining a culture of trust, integrity and professional growth starts with putting our people first. Our employees are our greatest strength, and we value the unique perspectives and talents they bring to our organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our wide range of Global Employee Networks connect people from across the organization, supporting career development and providing forums for individuals to share experiences on topics they&#39;re passionate about. Together, we are cultivating a connected culture where everyone has the opportunity to learn, grow and succeed together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Role can be based in any of our UK offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Jensen Hughes is a company fiercely committed to our purpose, our clients, and each other. Every single member of our team is essential to our success. Due to the continued growth and success of our External Walls and Facades team, we have an exciting opportunity for a Principal Engineer to join our market leading UK team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Principal Engineer, you will provide advanced technical delivery and project leadership across façade engineering and external wall fire consultancy services, you will be responsible for exercising independent engineering judgement on complex projects, leading technical workstreams, and ensuring that deliverables are technically robust, proportionate, and defensible. You will be a&amp;nbsp;senior technical contributor within project teams, support quality assurance and peer review processes, mentor developing engineers, and contribute to maintaining Jensen Hughes’ reputation for high-quality, risk-based advice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead technical delivery on façade and external wall projects of moderate to high complexity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Exercise independent engineering judgement in relation to façade systems, fire performance, remediation strategies, and compliance pathways.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prepare and oversee the preparation of external wall fire assessment reports (e.g. PAS 9980 appraisals), façade engineering reports, and technical notes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Review façade build-ups, materials, fire stopping provisions, cavity barriers, and remediation proposals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Assess test evidence, classification reports, product certifications, and desktop studies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify technical risks and develop proportionate mitigation strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Act as day-to-day technical lead on allocated projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead technical discussions with clients, architects, contractors, and multidisciplinary design teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide clear, structured technical advice aligned with legislation, statutory guidance, and industry standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If successful, here is what we will expect from you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Operate with increasing independence in technical judgement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrate commercial awareness in project delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Show readiness to transition toward Associate-level leadership responsibilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build recognised technical credibility internally and externally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to strengthening Jensen Hughes’ façade and external wall capability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Degree qualified in Engineering, Architecture, or a related technical discipline (or equivalent demonstrable experience).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Chartered or actively working towards chartership (strongly preferred).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Significant experience in façade engineering and/or external wall fire consultancy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of façade systems, construction methods, and performance requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead technical workstreams independently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in preparing and reviewing PAS 9980 appraisals or similar risk-based assessments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong report writing capability and structured technical reasoning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring junior engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Clear communication skills across technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our People Are Our Greatest Asset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Jensen Hughes, we know that our people are the foundation of our success. To attract and retain the best talent, we offer a competitive and comprehensive benefits package designed to support your wellbeing, work-life balance, and professional growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our UK and Ireland Benefits Include: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;33 days paid time off with an additional day after 3 years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading contributory pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;4 x life assurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Income protection scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Discretionary bonus scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Employee assistance programme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Enhanced parental-related pay&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Recognition and reward programmes to celebrate team efforts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Access to extensive technical training and resources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting Your Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We understand the importance of flexibility and balance. We&#39;re happy to discuss hybrid, part-time, and flexible working arrangements to suit both you and the business. We also offer:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours and patterns including early Friday finish&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible holiday use over Christmas/New Year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Enhanced holiday entitlement after three years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The option to carry over up to five unused holiday days into the next year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Commitment to Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our benefits represent a meaningful investment in both our people and the future of Jensen Hughes. We regularly review our benefits programme to ensure it aligns with statutory requirements, market trends, and the needs of our team. Any modifications will be carefully considered to support our employees and the company’s long-term goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-SG1 #LI-hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jensen Hughes is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Qualified candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, disability or protected veteran status.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Jensen Hughes, we embrace innovation and understand that people are increasingly using artificial intelligence (AI) tools like ChatGPT and other generative platforms to learn, prepare and communicate.&amp;nbsp; We have provided some guidelines regarding the responsible use of AI in the recruitment process.&amp;nbsp; Please click &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jensenhughes.com/careers/responsible-use-of-ai-in-the-jensen-hughes-recruitment-process&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to review.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The security of your personal data is important to us. Jensen Hughes has implemented reasonable physical, technical, and administrative security standards to protect personal data from loss, misuse, alteration, or destruction. We protect your personal data against unauthorized access, use, or disclosure, using security technologies and procedures, such as encryption and limited access. Only authorized individuals may access your personal data for the purpose for which it was collected, and these individuals receive training about the importance of protecting personal data.&amp;nbsp; Jensen Hughes is committed to compliance with all relevant data privacy laws in all areas where we do business, including, but not limited to, the GDPR and the CCPA.&amp;nbsp; Additionally, our service providers are contractually bound to maintain the confidentiality of personal data and may not use the information for any unauthorized purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Policy on use of 3rd party recruiting agency for direct placements&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jensen Hughes will occasionally augment a recruiting search through agencies for certain positions when business conditions warrant. Jensen Hughes will not accept resumes, inquiries or proposals from recruiting agencies as an acceptable method to consider a candidate. 3rd party recruiting agencies must sign a standard Jensen Hughes agreement after being evaluated and accepted by a Human Resources or Talent Acquisition manager, or member of the talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and employees of Jensen Hughes are not authorized to accept resumes, engage in fee-based searches through recruiting firms or sign a search agreement. Please note this policy does not apply to “staffing firms” or firms that are involved with hiring temporary staff. Any recruiting agency interested in being considered may contact our recruiting team at jensenhughesrecruiting.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://pages.8thlight.com/hubfs/Juan/New%20Careers%20Banner.svg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Waterloo, London, England, UK | &lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; (1 day per week in office)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 8th Light, we bring life to the best ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2006 and headquartered in Chicago, we are a technology solutions consultancy that partners with organisations from early-stage startups to the world&#39;s largest companies. We take on hard software challenges and turn them into durable results. We build agentic products, the platforms they run on, and the engineering and design at every layer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to quality means we deliver solutions we’re truly proud of, while our curiosity sparks innovation and breakthrough thinking. 8th Lights thrive in an environment that champions continuous education, fueling our growth through mentorship and hands-on work. We foster an open, collaborative culture grounded in honesty that builds trust, and believe true success is measured by the outcomes we create for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this kind of work and our kind of people energises you, you’ve found the right place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ve shown long-term repeated success on a variety of projects, typically over the course of 10+ years. You are a trusted expert and leader, often called upon to guide ambiguous initiatives and architect scalable solutions. You bring a blend of deep consulting acumen, technical expertise, and product thinking that drives measurable and impactful outcomes. In your previous experience, you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built and shipped production-grade platforms: the reusable foundations, tools, infrastructure, and workflows that help other teams shift faster and more reliably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taken AI and agentic systems from prototype to production, with a strong understanding of infrastructure, authentication, and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivered on&amp;nbsp; high-stakes consulting engagements across multiple language paradigms, stacks, ecosystems, and client industries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built high-quality, maintainable software collaboratively, incrementally, and through an approach tailored towards the unique needs of the clients you’ve served&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led the development and delivery of production-grade software using a variety of languages and frameworks, including but not limited to: Java, C#/.NET, Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, React, Go, Ruby, Rust, Scala, R, and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively experimented with AI development tools and translated that experimentation into faster, higher-quality delivery for your teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of understanding, assessing, and embracing new tooling and trends within the software industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built or integrated AI/ML features into products and systems, including recommendation engines, NLP, computer vision, predictive analytics, RAG pipelines, and agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully led modernisation and replatforming efforts to align legacy systems with short and long-term business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led and delivered solutions to architecture-level problems including scalability, security, reliability, performance, maintainability, and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitated alignment across technical and non-technical stakeholders to move initiatives forward through ambiguity and complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provided mentorship and team support at scale, while sharing knowledge and improving team practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboratively led stakeholders to balance technical considerations with product and user needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively sought out and effectively given feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do At 8th Light&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a go-to technologist and strategist within 8th Light, you’ll work with a variety of clients, typically one to two in a year, while continuing to deepen your and our collective domain expertise over the course of your career with us. You’ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly building trust with clients, demonstrating technical expertise and understanding of their domain and objectives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving platform engineering work at the client level, connecting long-term technical vision to what ships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading platform strategy and delivery across diverse platform types, connecting long-term vision to what ships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working pragmatically to balance technology choices while delivering high-quality work within deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising clients on architecture, scalability and platform evolution, connecting technical decisions to product and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating on systems that involve the full ML lifecycle from data ingestion and preprocessing, to model deployment, integration, and performance monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving innovation by proactively surfacing new technical approaches and product solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading or initiating formal feedback conversations with teams and clients via retrospectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulating and documenting outcomes and driving forward action items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the health of your team and 8th Light’s culture by modeling our Values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and managing high-level technical roadmaps for large engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building your network and maintaining relationships with clients and other industry leaders within your domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching client engineering teams, transferring knowledge and leveling up practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing client CTOs and executive decisions. Planning and execute technical work that involves stakeholders outside of project boundaries such as across a client&#39;s technical organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account teams on planning, opportunity identification, stakeholder relationships, and pre-sales scope shaping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitating retrospectives, strategy sessions, and technical deep-dives to improve team and project outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying, mitigating, and resolving blockers to team progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to 8th Light by serving as a mentor, leading or designing workshops internally or for clients, representing 8th Light in the tech community, or supporting our hiring processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrating leadership in scalable system design, modular architecture, and platform- or product-oriented development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing depth in testing strategies, observability, fault tolerance, and secure engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying architectural patterns to evaluate tradeoffs and drive clear, documented design rationale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work across many areas, and encourage anyone with the experience listed above to apply. We would particularly like to encourage applicants with experience in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform engineering: building reusable software foundations, internal developer platforms, and infrastructure that other teams build on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Engineering: including platforms like Databricks for data processing and analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering production agentic systems, including RAG pipelines, vector search, and agentic frameworks such as LangChain, LlamaIndex, CrewAI, AutoGen, and n8n&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DevSecOps &amp;amp; DevOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MLOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure as Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building a truly diverse, equitable, and inclusive workplace is an ongoing journey, and we’re excited to keep learning and growing together. We have a proud tradition of hiring talented colleagues with real-world career experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll be Supported&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 8th Light, we believe our people are our greatest asset. Their growth, well-being, and success shape our future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our wellness package is designed with the Whole YOU in mind and includes:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A robust L&amp;amp;D programme featuring unlimited access to thousands of books, courses, and expert-led training on the O&#39;Reilly learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual financial stipend and time allotment for learning &amp;amp; development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coworking support for our global team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12 weeks of new parent leave available for eligible employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See our full list of &lt;a href=&quot;http://8thlight.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 8th Light, we are committed to a compensation philosophy that is transparent, fair, and helps us attract and retain top talent in alignment with our company’s strategic growth goals and clients’ needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We benchmark our salaries using Geographic Structures to establish competitive pay ranges within the regions where 8th Lights live. Our pay ranges for our Principal Engineer position within London is: £92,818-£116,122 GBP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reach out to &lt;a ----- ----- for more relevant information pertaining to your local market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8th Light Hubs and Geographies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8th Light&#39;s culture is rooted in strong connections that extend across our teams, regions, and beyond client work. We are a distributed team across the United States, Canada, and the United Kingdom, with hubs in Chicago, London, Los Angeles, New York, and Seattle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London Co-working: &lt;/strong&gt;Employees working from our London hub follow a hybrid model, which includes a minimum of one day per week in our Waterloo Office. This co-working day is designed to encourage collaboration and further strengthen our community.In most cases, our consulting engagements do not require travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hope to see you apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;A Note on Your Privacy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;At 8th Light, one of our core values is&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Honesty that builds trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; — and that shapes how we approach hiring. We want you to have a clear picture of &lt;em&gt;who we are&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;how we handle your information&lt;/em&gt; throughout the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Before submitting your application, please take a moment to review our &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://8thlight.com/global-8th-light-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. By applying, you acknowledge that you&#39;ve read it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Optimisation Principal to lead experimentation-led growth (ELG) initiatives for our key global clients. In this role, you will define and execute data-driven growth strategies, champion a culture of continuous testing and learning, and integrate modern tech stacks to deliver measurable ROI and long-term business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Strategy &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Growth Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and deploy scalable Experimentation-Led Growth (ELG) frameworks, methodologies, and best practices tailored to client business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate Testing Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion an evidence-driven mindset across client organisations, shifting teams from basic A/B testing to sophisticated, hypothesis-led experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights to Action:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead cross-functional teams in designing, executing, and analysing experiments, translating complex data into strategic growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Global Client &amp;amp; Stakeholder Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the principal advisor for all global optimisation activities, building trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders across diverse regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver strategic forecasting, executive-level performance reporting, and actionable recommendations tied to core business KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Program &amp;amp; Commercial Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee global program operations, managing resources, timelines, and budgets to ensure on-schedule, in-scope execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Rigour:&lt;/strong&gt; Maximise resource allocation, monitor program throughput, and rigorously measure ROI to justify financial investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Technical Solution Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect integrated technical solutions, ensuring seamless interoperability across experimentation platforms, analytics suites, CMSs, CDPs, and personalisation engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee technical planning and delivery to ensure underlying data pipelines and tools effectively support client growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visionary Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience leading global growth/optimisation strategies, driving organisational change, and managing multi-region client portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Technical Stack Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on mastery and architectural understanding of:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Adobe Target, Optimizely (client/server-side, statistical rigor).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; GA4, Adobe Analytics, Amplitude (segmentation, event tracking).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CDP &amp;amp; Personalisation:&lt;/strong&gt; Segment, Tealium, Dynamic Yield, Braze (data unification, activation, real-time engines).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CMS &amp;amp; Data Infra:&lt;/strong&gt; AEM, Sitecore, data warehousing, governance, and pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Statistical Rigour:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency in statistical analysis for A/B testing, data synthesis, and translating metrics into business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flawless Program Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability in Agile/Waterfall delivery, resource planning, risk management, and budget oversight for complex, global accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong influencer capable of uniting product, engineering, marketing, and data science teams around shared growth goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp; WPP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; Enterprise Solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernisation, connecting strategy directly to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX, work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have received distinction as a leader in Commerce Services and CX Strategy Consulting by the Forrester Wave™&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;To find out more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://enterprisesolutions.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;enterprisesolutions.wpp.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; and follow us on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/wpp-enterprise-solutions&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA #LI-AS1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job’s mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer, Total Product Support&lt;/strong&gt; at ASM, you will take ownership of highly visible technical projects and drive them from planning through execution and delivery. Acting as the central point connecting engineering teams, operations, and customers, you will ensure that technical solutions are developed, tested, implemented, and supported successfully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone with a strong engineering foundation who enjoys bringing people together, solving problems, and turning technical requirements into clear actions. You do not need to be the subject matter expert in every technical area, but you should be comfortable working with engineers, understanding complex technical concepts, asking the right questions, and keeping projects moving forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate technical projects from initial planning through execution, customer delivery, and program close-out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop execution plans, define priorities, coordinate resources, and ensure key project milestones and deliverables are achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point of coordination between engineering teams, technical specialists, operations, management, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the build and qualification phase of technical solutions, including coordinating in-house testing, additional test equipment, technical evaluations, and readiness for customer implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineers to understand technical challenges, determine where additional expertise or consultation is required, and drive issues toward resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate directly with customers to understand requirements, provide transparent project updates, and support successful technical implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor project progress, identify risks and roadblocks early, and communicate openly when plans, deliverables, or timelines are at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze project and test outcomes, coordinate follow-up activities, and ensure programs are properly completed and transitioned into customer support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steer operational activities across multiple stakeholders while maintaining accountability for overall project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear and concise reporting on high-visibility projects to stakeholders and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Physics, Materials Science&lt;/strong&gt;, or another relevant technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid engineering foundation and the ability to understand and communicate technical concepts across different engineering disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project coordination skills with the ability to plan, organize, and drive activities from start to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, including the confidence to work with engineers, managers, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and accountability, with a proactive and hands-on approach to solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify risks, communicate challenges transparently, and escalate issues when necessary rather than waiting for problems to resolve themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly learn new technologies, processes, and technical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy, adaptability, and a strong “can-do” mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a multidisciplinary team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in semiconductor equipment, high-tech manufacturing, mechanical/electrical systems, or another complex engineering environment (not required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating multidisciplinary teams and translating between technical specialists, operations, management, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Relevant professional, internship, research, or project experience demonstrating the ability to coordinate technical work and drive execution is an advantage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and the confidence to challenge assumptions, raise concerns, and create alignment across different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured approach to project execution combined with the flexibility to adapt when technical priorities change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable taking accountability for highly visible projects where clear and timely communication is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally, typically &lt;strong&gt;1–2 times per year&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on project and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
